{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1e10e75f-89ac-8456-87b6-dacd0c738ce4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:50:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yuki Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:45:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Yuki Tran. I'm calling about a fence. I want to know if I need a permit to put one up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:45:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Is this for a home you own here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:45:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Well, it's at two twenty-eight Bellevue Avenue. That's, um, two... two... eight. Bellevue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two twenty-eight Bellevue Avenue, got it. And what kind of fence are you thinking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:45:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is for my vegetable garden. The deer come in and eat everything. So I want to keep the deer out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:46:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Do you know how tall you want it, and what material?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:46:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am planning composite. Not wood. And about four and a half feet tall. Four feet, six inches... no, wait. Four and a half feet is four feet, six inches. Yes. That."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, four foot six. Is it going around just the garden, or the whole yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the garden. In the back, behind the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. In general, a fence in Newport usually does need a permit, and the height and where it sits on the lot matter. Since you're on Bellevue, I'd also want to check whether your property falls in any special district that has extra review. Do you happen to know that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. I don't think so. Is that something you can look up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look at the address. Give me a moment. [pause] Okay, I'm pulling it up. Is the garden set back from the property lines, or would the fence be close to a neighbor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a little close on one side. Maybe six... six feet from the neighbor. I am not sure. I have not measured."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:47:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you'll want to measure before you apply. The application usually asks for a simple sketch of the lot showing where the fence goes. Hand-drawn is generally okay as long as it's clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Okay. I can do that. Now, I have a question. If I hire a contractor, does the contractor get the permit, or do I, the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either can do it. Often the contractor pulls it as part of the job, but the owner is ultimately responsible that it's done. So when you get quotes, ask each contractor straight out whether the permit is included."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Ask if the permit is included. I will write that down. [pause] Sorry, one moment. My dryer is buzzing again. The buzzer keeps going off. It does that. Let me... okay, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It will stop in a minute. So, how long does approval take? After I send the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a straightforward residential fence, it's usually not long, often a matter of days to a couple of weeks. If it needs extra review, it can take longer. I can't promise a date, but you'll hear from the office once it's reviewed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:49:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Days to a couple of weeks. Okay. And I should not build before I get the approval."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:49:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, wait until you have the permit in hand. Otherwise you could be asked to take it down or make changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Where do I get the application?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pick one up at City Hall in this office, or I can have one mailed to you. Would you like it mailed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, mail is better. I do not drive much. Please send to two twenty-eight Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Let me confirm the name. Yuki Tran, T-R-A-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. T... R... A... N. Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And in case we have questions, is there a callback number I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four... zero... one. [pause] Five... five... five. [pause] Zero... one... eight... five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-five. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll get that application out to you today. When it arrives, fill in the height, the material, and the sketch, and call back if anything's unclear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is all I need. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Tran. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
